; beancount's parser reports no syntax error until three tokens have been
; read since the last one. A comment that ends the erroring line is no
; token and its line break is one: the error on the line after each
; erroring line below is far enough from it, and reported.
  Expenses:Food 50 USD ; an indented line at top level, ending in a comment
2014-05-05 * "Transaction" Assets:Checking 100 USD

  ; an indented comment at top level
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash ; a comment after the open
	2020-01-01 open Equity:O

y" ; an invalid token, then a comment
2020-01-04 open Assets:B
  Assets:A   -1.00 USD
